{"formatVersion":1,"translationId":"BSB","textDirection":"ltr","bookId":"2JN","bookName":"2 John","chapters":[{"number":1,"lastVerse":13,"verses":[{"number":1,"lines":[{"text":"The elder,"},{"text":"To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth—"}]},{"number":2,"lines":[{"text":"because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:"}]},{"number":3,"lines":[{"text":"Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."}]},{"number":4,"lines":[{"text":"I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."}]},{"number":5,"lines":[{"text":"And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."}]},{"number":6,"lines":[{"text":"And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love."}]},{"number":7,"lines":[{"text":"For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist."}]},{"number":8,"lines":[{"text":"Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for, but that you may be fully rewarded."}]},{"number":9,"lines":[{"text":"Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son."}]},{"number":10,"lines":[{"text":"If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him."}]},{"number":11,"lines":[{"text":"Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds."}]},{"number":12,"lines":[{"text":"I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face, so that our joy may be complete."}]},{"number":13,"lines":[{"text":"The children of your elect sister send you greetings."}]}]}]}
